l Business Development Coordinator UniSC Sunshine Coast. UniSC Moreton Bay Individual contributor, International , L6 $95,986 - $103,873 +17% super, Professional Support UniSC’s international recruitment success by delivering targeted onshore strategies, strengthening education agent partnerships and building pathways that attract international students and convert opportunities into enrolments. Finance Business Partner UniSC Sunshine Coast Financial Services, L7 $105,843 - $115,703 +17% super, Professional Partner with senior leaders to shape financial decisions that directly support UniSC’s strategy, growth and sustainability. Senior Lecturer in Prosthetics and Orthotics UniSC Sunshine Coast Academic, LC $144,979 - $167,068 +17% super, School of Health An exceptional opportunity to shape the future of prosthetics and orthotics education, advance impactful research, and strengthen partnerships with clinical and industry leaders at a university committed to innovation and real-world impact. Technician (Nursing and Midwifery) UniSC Fraser Coast Academic Support Unit, Individual contributor, L5 $82,843 - $93,358 +17% super, Technical Support Join a growing UniSC team, with multiple newly created opportunities supporting the expansion of our Nursing and Midwifery programs. Join our talent community! Sign up for job alerts First Name (required) a6ea59af Last Name (required) 450952f2 Email (required) 175125c7 Job Alert e3dd5581 Finalize your job alert by selecting criteria from the dropdowns below. You can select multiple options from each dropdown by returning to the combobox and re-entering the list of options. Submit at the end to create your job alert. Categories Casual Professional Clinical Trials L1 $38.88 per hour (casual) Casual Professional Clinical Trials L1 $38.88 per hour (casual) Employment Type Casual Casual Locations Health Hub Morayfield, QLD, Australia UniSC Sunshine Coast, QLD, Australia Health Hub Morayfield, QLD, Australia UniSC Sunshine Coast, QLD, A